yment opportunities.\"}, \"leadershipTeam\": {\"title\": \"Examirror – Leadership Team\", \"enabled\": true, \"members\": [{\"id\": \"1791727620319\", \"name\": \"New Leader Name\", \"role\": \"EXECUTIVE\", \"imageUrl\": \"/uploads/branding/img-1791728150615-515.png\"}, {\"id\": \"1\", \"name\": \"Dulal Kanti Mahato\", \"role\": \"DIRECTOR 1\", \"imageUrl\": \"/uploads/branding/img-1791728155617-103.png\"}, {\"id\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Laxmi Priya Mahato\", \"role\": \"DIRECTOR 2\", \"imageUrl\": \"/uploads/branding/img-1791728160788-219.png\"}, {\"id\": \"3\", \"name\": \"Karan Mahato\", \"role\": \"ACCOUNTANT\", \"imageUrl\": \"/uploads/branding/img-1791728167738-868.png\"}], \"subtitle\": \"Experienced leadership steering excellence in national skill education and vocational certification.\"}, \"directorMessage\": {\"name\": \"Dulal Kanti Mahato\", \"message\": \"Our priority is ensuring that every enrolled student receives rigorous hands-on technical training with verifiable certificates. We welcome enthusiastic educators to partner with us as authorized study centers.\", \"designation\": \"Director & Chief Executive Officer\"}}','2026-10-11 14:16:09'),(52,'contact','{\"map\": {\"embedUrl\": \"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Patna%20Bihar&t=&z=13&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed\"}, \"header\": {\"title\": \"Contact & Support Desk\", \"subtitle\": \"Get in touch with our institutional support team or locate our administrative headquarters.\"}, \"social\": {\"youtube\": \"#\", \"facebook\": \"#\", \"linkedin\": \"#\", \"instagram\": \"#\"}, \"contactInfo\": {\"phone1\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"phone2\": \"+91 87654 32109\", \"address\": \"Gali no4,near K -14, kankarbagh, Sampatchak, Patna, Bihar-800020\", \"whatsapp\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"emailGeneral\": \"saurabhcsjnu@gmail.com\", \"workingHours\": \"Monday to Saturday: 09:30 AM – 06:30 PM (Sunday Closed)\", \"emailFranchise\": \"saurabhcsjnu@gmail.com\"}}','2026-10-14 02:57:50'),(58,'demo_showcase','{\"title\": \"Official Specimen & Verification Showcase\", \"enabled\": true, \"subtitle\": \"Explore authentic demo certificates, authorized study center licenses, and online verifiable student marksheets.\", \"demoCenter\": {\"city\": \"New Delhi-110001\", \"phone\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"state\": \"Delhi\", \"centerCode\": \"CENT001\", \"centerName\": \"Delhi Main Center\", \"directorName\": \"Center Director\", \"sampleImageUrl\": \"\"}, \"demoStudent\": {\"rollNo\": \"ROL-10007\", \"centerCode\": \"CENT001\", \"courseName\": \"Full Stack Web Development\", \"studentName\": \"pawan Gupta\", \"enrollmentNo\": \"EXAM-2026-1007\", \"sampleImageUrl\": \"/uploads/students/photo-1791775370048-531.jpg\"}, \"demoCertificate\": {\"grade\": \"Grade A+ (94%)\", \"title\": \"Full Stack Web Development\", \"rollNo\": \"ROL-10005\", \"issueDate\": \"15-08-2026\", \"courseName\": \"Full Stack Web Development\", \"studentName\": \"aman kumar gupta\", \"enrollmentNo\": \"EXAM-2026-1005\", \"certificateNo\": \"EXAM-2026-777205\", \"sampleImageUrl\": \"\"}}','2026-10-14 03:02:42'),(73,'gallery','{\"header\": {\"title\": \"Moments & Academic Activities Gallery\", \"subtitle\": \"Witness the vibrant campus life, lab practicals, annual convocation, and student achievements across our affiliated center network.\"}, \"categories\": [\"All\", \"Convocations\", \"Lab Practicals\", \"Workshops\", \"Award Ceremonies\", \"Center Inaugurations\"]}','2026-10-15 01:33:57'),(74,'global','{\"brand\": {\"tagline\": \"Empowering India Through Skill Development & Vocational Training\", \"siteName\": \"Examirror\", \"announcement\": \"📢 ADMISSIONS OPEN 2026-27 | FREE CENTER FRANCHISE REGISTRATION | ISO 9001:2015 CERTIFIED\", \"siteShortName\": \"EXAMIRROR\"}, \"footer\": {\"disclaimer\": \"Examirror is an autonomous educational organization registered under the Indian Trust Act & MSME Government of India.\", \"copyrightText\": \"© 2026 Examirror. All Rights Reserved.\"}, \"header\": {\"supportEmail\": \"saurabhcsjnu@gmail.com\", \"helplinePhone\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"showAnnouncement\": true}}','2026-10-15 01:33:59');
