ash.com/photo-1474487548417-781cb71495f3?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800','• RRB NTPC Pattern\n• 3 marks for correct answer, 1 mark deduction for incorrect\n• Auto-calculates sectional accuracy','Government Railway Exam','English + Hindi','INTERMEDIATE',2,149.00,0,60,120,'ALL_CENTRES',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-02 12:47:20','2026-10-02 12:47:20'),(11,'Tally Prime & GST Accounting Certification Mock','tally-prime-gst-mock-1790945240094',5,'Practical certification mock test covering Double Entry Bookkeeping, Ledger Creation, Inventory Valuation, GST Invoicing, E-Way Bill, and TDS calculations in Tally Prime.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224154-26032ffc0d07?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800','• Accounting Standard Compliant\n• 4 marks per question\n• Detailed journal voucher explanations provided','Professional Diploma Mock','English + Hindi','INTERMEDIATE',2,249.00,0,60,90,'ALL_CENTRES',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-02 12:47:20','2026-10-02 12:47:20'),(12,'Logical Reasoning & Quantitative Speed Drill 2026','logical-reasoning-speed-drill-1790945240095',6,'Rapid-fire free assessment pack designed to boost mental calculation speed, pattern recognition, seating arrangements, and analytical syllogisms.','/uploads/branding/img-1791910387309-267.png','• Fast-paced 30 minute mock\n• 4 marks per question with 1 mark negative marking\n• 100% Free for all authorized center students','General Assessment','English + Hindi','BEGINNER',2,0.00,1,30,180,'ALL_CENTRES',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-02 12:47:20','2026-10-13 16:53:15');
